WEBVTT

00:06:28.646 --> 00:06:30.504
to prove to everybody that empirically,

00:06:30.528 --> 00:06:32.105
these dates really are terrible.

00:06:32.129 --> 00:06:33.152
(Laughter)

00:06:33.176 --> 00:06:37.270
So I started tracking things like
really stupid, awkward, sexual remarks;

00:06:37.294 --> 00:06:39.449
bad vocabulary;

00:06:39.473 --> 00:06:42.504
the number of times a man
forced me to high-five him.

00:06:42.528 --> 00:06:44.678
(Laughter)

00:06:44.702 --> 00:06:49.068
So I started to crunch some numbers,

00:06:49.092 --> 00:06:51.743
and that allowed me
to make some correlations.

00:06:51.767 --> 00:06:54.367
So as it turns out,

00:06:54.391 --> 00:06:59.465
for some reason, men who drink Scotch
reference kinky sex immediately.

00:06:59.489 --> 00:07:01.602
(Laughter)